# Leyline of the Guildpact costs {G/W}{G/U}{B/G}{R/G}: each hybrid symbol paid with either of its colors (CR 107.4e). A
# Forest, a Plains, an Island and a Mountain pay it - the Plains the {G/W}, the Island the {G/U}, the Forest the {B/G}, the
# Mountain the {R/G} - so it is offered (CR 601.2g-h), though paying the {G/W} with the Forest would leave the {B/G} unpaid.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Plains
Island
Mountain
Leyline of the Guildpact
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

